OL,3,GNEWSANew violence laws could cost
OL,4,Agovernment up to #7m
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew laws tackling domestic abuse and
OL,7,Fsexual violence could cost Jersey up to
OL,8,F#7m and result in up to 369 additional
OL,9,Foffences being recorded each year,
OL,10,Fministers have said.
OL,12,FThe government said the funding would
OL,13,Fhelp police, courts and support
OL,14,Fservices cope with increased demand
OL,15,Fcreated by the legislation.
OL,17,FThe laws, approved by the States in
OL,18,FMarch, introduced new offences covering
OL,19,Fstalking, non-fatal strangulation and
OL,20,Fintimate image abuse.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
