OL,3,GNEWSANew violence laws could cost
OL,4,Agovernment up to #7m
OL,5,
OL,6,FJustice and Home Affairs Minister Helen
OL,7,FMiles said the funding model aimed to
OL,8,Fensure "the demands generated from the
OL,9,Fnew legislation are matched with
OL,10,Fadequate resourcing at the point of
OL,11,Fneed".
